<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>calculator-revision-brief.md</title><style>body{font:18px system-ui;line-height:1.6;max-width:1000px;margin:2rem auto;padding:1rem;color:#17252d;background:white}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}table{border-collapse:collapse}td,th{border:1px solid #777;padding:.5rem}a{color:#064b8c}</style><main><h1>Add a comparison without breaking the calculator — learner brief</h1>
<p>Fictional Northstar Services training material.</p>
<h2>Change</h2>
<p>Same original calculator contract, shared price/setup. A10 seats/B12, price25.50, setup100. B-minus-A difference. Clear stale comparison if B invalid. Standalone starter supplied.</p>
<h2>Task</h2>
<p>The controller wants to compare two seat-count scenarios using the same price and setup.</p>
<h2>Actions</h2>
<ol>
<li>State the requested change while keeping price/setup shared and the original formula fixed.</li>
<li>Ask AI to modify your source or the supplied standalone starter with a labeled second scenario.</li>
<li>Rerun every original valid and invalid case before testing the comparison.</li>
<li>Verify the supplied A/B outputs and difference sign.</li>
<li>Clear B after a successful result and confirm the comparison is removed or explicitly invalid, not stale.</li>
<li>Document what changed and which original behaviors still pass.</li>
</ol>
<h2>Output</h2>
<p>Change request; revised source; original-case regression results; comparison results; invalid-B behavior.</p>
<h2>Supplied local practice files</h2>
<ul>
<li>calculator-starter.html</li>
</ul>
<p>Keep these files together. Scripts take explicit paths; choose new output folders. Use a plain text editor to inspect source before running. Browser prototypes open locally; do not deploy them.</p>
</main></html>